cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Wald-Q4B, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Wald-Q4B v1.2: an open-weight 4B decision model with calibrated option probabilities"
abstract: >-
  Wald-Q4B is an open-weight 4B decision model built on Qwen3.5-4B-Base. Given a
  state and typed questions (choice, yes/no, score), it returns a calibrated
  probability for every option through a Jev-compatible POST /v1/systemone API,
  in one pass or after an optional short thought. Weights and serving code are
  Apache-2.0. Independent project; not affiliated with TypeSafe AI.
authors:
  - name: "Wald-4B authors"
    alias: Harry19081
    website: "https://huggingface.co/Harry19081"
version: "v1.2"
date-released: "2026-10-01"
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://huggingface.co/org2ai/Wald-4B"
repository-code: "https://github.com/org2AI/wald-4b"
repository-artifact: "https://huggingface.co/org2ai/Wald-4B"
keywords:
  - decision model
  - calibrated probabilities
  - tool selection
  - agent routing
  - classification
  - Jev-compatible API
  - Qwen3.5
